## Why This Is Asked
This checks robustness of error handling, tenant isolation, and rollout discipline in multi-tenant KCNA systems.

## Key Concepts
- Per-tenant DLQ routing and isolation
- Retry budgeting and backoff strategy
- Idempotent replays and deduplication
- Retention, auditing, and operator visibility
- Canary rollout and rollback plans

## Code Example
